1
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,760
If this is really Fang Qingcheng,

2
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:19,600
I'm afraid Xin'er will never come back.

3
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:21,200
Young Master.

4
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,440
We guessed right.

5
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:30,120
What do we do now?

6
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,440
Put on a full show.

7
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:33,400
After all, Qingcheng

8
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:36,400
must stay alive to attend the Makeup Selection Ceremony.

9
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,040
Zi'er,

10
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:39,160
go find Fang Zhuozhuo again.

11
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:40,080
Yes.

12
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:42,160
Cousin.

13
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:44,960
Cousin.

14
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:46,720
Cousin.

15
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:51,300
I didn't expect that when we parted that day,

16
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:53,280
it would be forever.

17
00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:01,360
No.

18
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,200
This is not my cousin.

19
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:05,960
Not Fang Qingcheng?

20
00:01:08,039 --> 00:01:09,770
I have bathed my cousin before.

21
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:12,760
She doesn't have a birthmark there.

22
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:14,000
Then why

23
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:16,760
is she wearing Fang Qingcheng's clothes?

24
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:18,200
My cousin's dress

25
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:20,200
is this year's new style.

26
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:21,850
Yunjin Pavilion

27
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:24,450
made no less than a hundred of them.

28
00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:31,570
Find some people

29
00:01:31,960 --> 00:01:32,960
to bury this girl.

30
00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:42,560
Do you really think, Young Master,

31
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,420
that it was a trap set by Lady Fang?

32
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:48,320
We carried out the rescue of Xin'er

33
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:49,680
flawlessly.

34
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,039
The only people who entered the secret room,

35
00:01:51,039 --> 00:01:52,100
besides you and me,

36
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,360
were her.

37
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:54,770
But what if Lady Fang

38
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:58,220
tells Fang Qingcheng about your intention to kill?

39
00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:00,850
That's exactly what I want.

40
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:03,720
If she goes to find Fang Qingcheng,

41
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:05,520
it saves us the trouble of looking for her.

42
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:06,840
Find a few reliable people

43
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:08,240
to keep an eye on her whereabouts

44
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:09,970
and see if she leaves the manor.

45
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:27,570
When the moon is full, old friends return.

46
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:34,450
The Mid-Autumn Festival is approaching.

47
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:47,520
Watered with unrooted water at Yin hour every day,

48
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,640
and steamed and dried the gold powder soil three times.

49
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:52,300
I followed all the steps Chu Shengyi mentioned.

50
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:53,920
It's been a few days.

51
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:55,079
Strange.

52
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:56,810
Why hasn't it sprouted?

53
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,010
Who's there?

54
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:14,000
It's you.

55
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:16,240
I didn't expect to run into you here.

56
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:19,640
I was surprised

57
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:21,720
and exposed my whereabouts.

58
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,560
So you are

59
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,640
the gardener ordered to plant the Qionghua,

60
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:28,800
Lady Fang.

61
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:31,800
Interesting.

62
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:34,450
I didn't expect the Qionghua seeds

63
00:03:35,079 --> 00:03:36,440
to end up in your hands.

64
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,860
Congratulations.

65
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,450
Why are you here?

66
00:03:46,720 --> 00:03:48,840
Qionghua seeds are rare,

67
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:50,700
and Qionghua is also a rare thing.

68
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:51,200
I'm just

69
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:53,120
curious.

70
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:57,540
You won't expose me, will you?

71
00:03:58,120 --> 00:04:02,040
It took me a lot of effort to sneak in.

72
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:05,330
If you want to see the Qionghua,

73
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,680
you'll have to wait a few days.

74
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:07,940
It hasn't bloomed yet.

75
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:10,480
That's a pity.

76
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,080
In a few days,

77
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:13,680
I'll be leaving Kuizhou.

78
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:21,440
Quantan wolf-tooth arrow.

79
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:22,920
A souvenir.

80
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:24,640
This injury is old.

81
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:28,800
The scar is too dark.

82
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:30,320
Just using lead powder

83
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:31,380
might not cover it.

84
00:04:57,880 --> 00:04:58,540
Don't move.

85
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:15,120
In all my years of traveling,

86
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:17,700
everyone just stares at my goods.

87
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:20,840
This is the first time

88
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:23,100
someone has stared at my scar.

89
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:42,640
Beautiful.

90
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:45,260
You have such skillful hands.

91
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:47,760
Your craftsmanship is really good.

92
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,280
What's wrong?

93
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:54,360
In Kuizhou,

94
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:57,050
a thin woman can't even be a makeup artist.

95
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:58,720
This is the first time

96
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:01,490
someone praised my craftsmanship

97
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:05,040
instead of Qingcheng's.

98
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,400
In Kuizhou,

99
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,760
life for a thin woman is indeed not easy.

100
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:12,010
Have you ever thought about

101
00:06:13,280 --> 00:06:15,010
living a different way of life?

102
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:17,520
A different

103
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:18,920
way of life?

104
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:19,640
Yes.

105
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,360
The world is big.

106
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:23,640
With your excellent makeup skills,

107
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:25,400
you can make a living anywhere.

108
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:27,120
Why be trapped in this hellhole?

109
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,360
I have heard that

110
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:30,440
outside of Kuizhou,

111
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:32,880
thin girls can write and do accounts,

112
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,360
read and reason,

113
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,560
and even marry freely.

114
00:06:38,840 --> 00:06:40,159
But to get out

115
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,159
is not easy.

116
00:06:43,280 --> 00:06:44,280
As a woman,

117
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:46,600
getting a travel permit

118
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:48,880
is as hard as climbing to heaven.

119
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:50,680
Moreover,

120
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:53,920
I still have unfinished business here.

121
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:58,720
I

122
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:00,660
don't like owing favors the most.

123
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,360
This painting is beautiful.

124
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,200
I like it.

125
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,400
Then I must give you a gift in return.

126
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:07,040
Tell me what you want.

127
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,800
As long as it exists in this world,

128
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:09,920
I can get it for you.

129
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:13,000
As for gold and silver,

130
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,240
I don't need them.

131
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:17,820
I've been watched closely lately

132
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,600
and can't leave the mansion.

133
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:24,600
How about you help me put on a play?

134
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,720
A play?

135
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:29,380
Why is Nanny Chang here again?

136
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:33,180
She said she's here to check the progress of planting flowers.

137
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:36,850
Let's go.

138
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:41,159
Nanny.

139
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:43,120
Planting this flower this time

140
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:45,040
took me a lot of effort.

141
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:47,000
Wait until the day it sprouts,

142
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:47,960
I will definitely

143
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,420
tell Mother immediately.

144
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:52,520
You have worked hard, Lady Fang.

145
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:55,000
I will go and report now.

146
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:00,440
Nanny.

147
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:01,980
You have worked hard, Sir.

148
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:05,280
The sprouting of the viburnum flower is just around the corner.

149
00:08:05,280 --> 00:08:07,040
I will go and report now.

150
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:10,320
Madam will surely sleep well tonight.

151
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:23,160
Is this it?

152
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:26,560
May I ask,

153
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:30,360
has anyone gone missing in the mansion recently?

154
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:34,760
My cousin is missing.

155
00:08:35,159 --> 00:08:35,720
Daoist,

156
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,919
can you calculate where she is?

157
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:40,159
Is your cousin

158
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:42,679
the master of this mansion?

159
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:44,960
Yes, she is the Madam.

160
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:46,680
That's right.

161
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:49,120
I just arrived in Kuizhou today,

162
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:52,280
and saw blood and evil spirits soaring into the sky over your mansion.

163
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:53,280
Your cousin's disappearance

164
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:56,480
must be related to the strange phenomenon in the mansion.

165
00:08:56,760 --> 00:08:59,640
Could you tell me the Madam's birth dates?

166
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:01,880
Wait.

167
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:03,880
Husband,

168
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:05,720
my cousin has been missing for many days.

169
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:08,450
What's the harm in letting the Daoist take a look?

170
00:09:24,520 --> 00:09:27,680
Did the Madam get married recently?

171
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:29,160
Is the other master

172
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:31,920
of this mansion present?

173
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,160
I am.

174
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:34,560
Then please, Sir,

175
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:36,240
tell me your birth dates.

176
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:42,080
Yes.

177
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,680
What's the harm in calculating?

178
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,440
This is bad.

179
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:10,800
My cousin...

180
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,280
Something really happened.

181
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:14,200
The birth dates of the Madam and you

182
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:17,040
are originally a situation of the Owl God snatching food.

183
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:19,040
They both have wealthy lives.

184
00:10:19,560 --> 00:10:21,160
If they separate, it's fine.

185
00:10:21,160 --> 00:10:22,240
But if they are together,

186
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,970
there will be a great disaster.

187
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:26,810
It will even implicate their closest relatives.

188
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:27,640
Daoist,

189
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:29,450
is there a way to solve this?

190
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:32,520
If the Madam and the husband are still entangled,

191
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,880
the husband's relatives

192
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:37,120
will also suffer a bloody disaster.

193
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:39,280
Nonsense!

194
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:41,690
Why are you leaving?

195
00:10:43,040 --> 00:10:44,040
What an attitude.

196
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,060
Daoist,

197
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:46,760
please save my cousin.

198
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:47,480
I can't.

199
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:06,320
Master's complexion is much better recently.

200
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,680
I made this Zichen Liangyi soup

201
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:14,920
myself.

202
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:16,200
It is brewed

203
00:11:16,280 --> 00:11:18,080
with pinellia and dwarf lilyturf.

204
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:20,560
Try it, my Lord. It's good for your health.

205
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:23,240
Be careful, it's hot.

206
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:26,970
How thoughtful.

207
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:31,680
Momo, you were not serving in the courtyard

208
00:11:31,680 --> 00:11:33,480
today.

209
00:11:33,760 --> 00:11:34,800
To report to the Commander,

210
00:11:34,800 --> 00:11:37,600
I just went to the Third Young Master's residence.

211
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:40,080
Thanks to Madam's grace,

212
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:42,680
Fang has been tasked with cultivating viburnum.

213
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:45,080
I went there to check on it.

214
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,040
Fang.

215
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:47,800
Her again.

216
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:53,250
You think highly of her.

217
00:11:54,800 --> 00:11:56,720
Such vulgar and lowly people,

218
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:58,120
I really dislike them.

219
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:59,280
However,

220
00:11:59,880 --> 00:12:01,200
Those viburnum seeds

221
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:03,200
were specially found for me by Yi.

222
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:05,520
I didn't want to break Yi's heart.

223
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:07,400
Fang volunteered to plant them.

224
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:10,840
I thought her gardening skills were indeed good,

225
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:12,530
so I allowed her to do it.

226
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:13,280
Yes.

227
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:15,320
I just went to take a look.

228
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:16,460
Fang has indeed

229
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:19,000
taken good care of the seeds.

230
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:20,200
They will sprout

231
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,480
very soon.

232
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,810
It is already a joke for a pariah

233
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:28,600
to marry into the family as a substitute.

234
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:31,120
Since it's a joke,

235
00:12:31,400 --> 00:12:32,720
it should end.

236
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:34,260
Rest assured, my Lord.

237
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:36,850
I have been thinking about this recently.

238
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:38,000
However,

239
00:12:38,160 --> 00:12:40,960
Fang Qingcheng's whereabouts are still unknown,

240
00:12:41,080 --> 00:12:42,840
and there are all kinds of rumors out there.

241
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:43,920
And Fang Zhuozhuo

242
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:46,320
is Fang Qingcheng's cousin.

243
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:48,760
If we rashly kick her out now,

244
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:51,800
I'm afraid the rumors will get worse.

245
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:54,000
I thought we could delay it for now.

246
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:55,860
Things will work out eventually.

247
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:57,780
As for this matter,

248
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:59,200
you just handle it.

249
00:12:59,400 --> 00:12:59,960
Yes.

250
00:13:03,640 --> 00:13:05,440
Do you have anything else to say?

251
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:10,320
When I was leaving the Third Young Master's residence,

252
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,520
I met a Taoist priest.

253
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:14,050
He said in the Master's residence,

254
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:16,280
there was a bloody aura soaring into the sky.

255
00:13:16,280 --> 00:13:17,140
The priest also

256
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:20,800
asked for the birth dates of the Third Young Master and Lady Fang.

257
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:21,920
He said they are

258
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:26,320
in a situation of evil spirits snatching food.

259
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:29,120
If the Third Young Master continues to be entangled with the Young Madam,

260
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:29,720
I'm afraid

261
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:32,600
it will bring disaster to his closest relatives.

262
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:33,400
How dare you!

263
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:38,060
Calm down, my Lord.

264
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:38,840
Your health is important.

265
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:39,640
Yes, yes, yes.

266
00:13:45,040 --> 00:13:46,800
The Third Young Master's marriage

267
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:48,520
to that merchant woman

268
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,450
should be canceled.

269
00:13:53,280 --> 00:13:54,210
You go handle it.

270
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:56,440
Make it decent.

271
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:58,120
Yes.

272
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:01,330
This priest is too ridiculous.

273
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:03,240
Even if I gave him my birth date,

274
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:05,300
he could probably make something up.

275
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,840
The engagement absolutely cannot be canceled.

276
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:10,040
If Qingcheng leaves,

277
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:11,570
whose life will I use

278
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:13,420
to exchange for Xin's?

279
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:15,440
What do you want to do, Young Master?

280
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:21,040
The origin of this Taoist priest is unknown.

281
00:14:21,040 --> 00:14:22,400
But looking at his eyes,

282
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:26,580
I feel like I've seen them somewhere before.

283
00:14:28,640 --> 00:14:29,880
Go to the black market.

284
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:30,360
Yes.

285
00:14:52,280 --> 00:14:53,720
Our Grand Governor

286
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:54,960
has become increasingly obsessed with divination

287
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:56,960
since he fell ill.

288
00:14:57,440 --> 00:15:00,160
Qingcheng has no interests involved with him.

289
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:01,720
As long as Nanny Chang

290
00:15:01,920 --> 00:15:04,180
can convey the Taoist priest's message,

291
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:07,560
the marriage between Qingcheng and Chu Shengyi

292
00:15:07,560 --> 00:15:08,720
will naturally be dissolved.

293
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:10,180
Then what about you, Miss?

294
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:14,920
Qingcheng carries the future of Yanzhi Pavilion on her shoulders.

295
00:15:14,920 --> 00:15:16,920
I must ensure her safe escape first.

296
00:15:17,520 --> 00:15:18,600
As for me,

297
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:20,920
there are plenty of ways.

298
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:23,920
But the key to all this is...

299
00:15:34,040 --> 00:15:36,240
The preliminary selection of the Makeup Ceremony is approaching.

300
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,170
There's no time.

301
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,130
The Qionghua flower

302
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:41,440
must break ground now.
